    "lace when\n    `i == j`. Faults (`index_out_of_bounds`) when either index is `>= len`.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collect"
    "ions\u{1f}HashMap\u{1f}struct\u{1f}export struct HashMap<K, V>\u{1f}A hash table mapping keys of type `K` to values of t"
    "ype `V`, kept in insertion order.\u{1f}\u{1f}export struct HashMap<K, V>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    A hash"
    " table mapping keys of type `K` to values of type `V`, kept in insertion order.\n\n    `K` must be a k"
    "ey type: an integer type, `bool`, `str` or `String`, or a struct or enum built only of key\n    types"
