    "self (`HashMap::get(&m, 7)`); a struct or\n    enum key by reference, `&k`. The map owns its keys and"
    " values and destroys\n    them with itself.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap::new\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashMap::new"
