    "td::collections`\n\n    A new, empty map.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap::clone\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashMap::clon"
    "e<K: clone, V: clone>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, shared> m) : HashMap<K, V>\u{1f}A new map holding copies of the "
