    "port fn HashMap::clear<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m)\u{1f}Removes every entry of `m`, destroying"
    " them first to last, each entry's key and then its value.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn HashMap::clear<K, V>(ref<HashMa"
    "p<K, V>, exclusive> m)\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    Removes every entry of `m`, destroying them fi"
    "rst to last, each entry's key and then its value.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap::len\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashM"
