    "ey_at<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, shared> m, usize i) : ref<K, shared>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    T"
    "he key of entry `i`, in insertion order.\n\n    Faults (`index_out_of_bounds`) when `i >= len`. Consta"
    "nt time, but logarithmic in the size of the map\n    while places that `HashMap::remove` emptied are "
    "not yet closed up.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap::value_at\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashMap::value_at<K, V>(ref<Has"
    "hMap<K, V>, shared> m, usize i) : ref<V, shared>\u{1f}The value of entry `i`, in insertion order.\u{1f}\u{1f}export"
    " fn HashMap::value_at<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, shared> m, usize i) : ref<V, shared>\n    in `std::col"
    "lections`\n\n    The value of entry `i`, in insertion order.\n\n    Faults (`index_out_of_bounds`) when "
