    "sert<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m, K k, V v) : Option<V>\u{1f}Adds key `k` with value `v`; retur"
    "ns the old value if `k` was already present, otherwise `None`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn HashMap::insert<K, V>(ref<"
    "HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m, K k, V v) : Option<V>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    Adds key `k` with "
