    "ut m, 5, 55)) == 50);\n        assert(HashMap::len(&m) == 2);\n        assert(*HashMap::key_at(&m, 0) "
    "== 5 && *HashMap::value_at(&m, 0) == 55);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap::entry\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashMap::en"
    "try<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m, probe<K> k, V fresh) : ref<V, exclusive>\u{1f}The value for th"
