    "f it is absent.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn HashMap::entry<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m, probe<K> k, V fresh"
    ") : ref<V, exclusive>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    The value for the key `k` probes, as an exclusi"
    "ve reference, adding a copy of the key with the value `fresh`\n    first if it is absent.\n\n    `k` is"
