    " &words)\n        {\n            *HashMap::entry(&mut counts, *w, 0) += 1;\n        }\n        i32 three"
    " = 3;\n        assert(*Option::unwrap(HashMap::get(&counts, three)) == 2);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}HashMap"
    "::get\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn HashMap::get<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, shared> m, probe<K> k) : Option<ref<V, shar"
