    "y priority queue in the key types' own order, smallest first (as `Vec::sort` orders).\n\n    `T` must "
    "be a key type or a float (in `Vec::sort`'s order, a NaN last); for any other `T` use\n    `PriorityQu"
    "eue::new_by`.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}PriorityQueue::new_by\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn PriorityQueue::new_by<T>(fn(ref<"
