    "e one pushed first comes out first. Logarithmic in the length.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}PriorityQueue::pee"
    "k\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn PriorityQueue::peek<T>(ref<PriorityQueue<T>, shared> q) : Option<ref<T, shared>>\u{1f}The "
