    ") when fewer than `sizeof<T>()` bytes remain from `at`.\n\n    Example, \"read_le: round trip\":\n       "
    " Vec<u8> out = Vec::new();\n        Vec::push_be(&mut out, 0x0102: u16);\n        Vec::push_le(&mut ou"
    "t, -2: i16);\n        assert(out[0] == 0x01 && out[1] == 0x02 && out[2] == 0xfe && out[3] == 0xff);\n "
