    "ync\u{1f}Atomic::load\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Atomic::load<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a) : T\u{1f}The value `a` h"
    "olds.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Atomic::load<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a) : T\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    The "
