    "red> a, T v)\u{1f}Replaces the value `a` holds with `v`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Atomic::store<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<"
    "T>, shared> a, T v)\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Replaces the value `a` holds with `v`.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Atomi"
    "c::swap\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Atomic::swap<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a, T v) : T\u{1f}Replaces the value "
    "`a` holds with `v`, giving the value it held.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Atomic::swap<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, sha"
    "red> a, T v) : T\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Replaces the value `a` holds with `v`, giving the value it "
