    "mic<T>, shared> a, T expected, T new) : Result<T, T>\u{1f}Replaces the value with `new` if it is `expecte"
    "d`, as one step.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Atomic::compare_exchange<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a, T expecte"
    "d, T new) : Result<T, T>\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Replaces the value with `new` if it is `expected`, "
