    "\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Adds `n` to the value `a` holds, giving the value it held.\n\n    Faults (`ar"
    "ith_overflow`) when the sum does not fit `T`, as `+` does, and then the value is unchanged.\n    `fet"
    "ch_add_wrapping` wraps instead.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Atomic::fetch_sub\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Atomic::fetch_sub<T: inte"
