    "se and with `n`, giving the value it held.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Atomic::fetch_or\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Atomic::fetch_o"
    "r<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a, T n) : T\u{1f}Replaces the value `a` holds with its bitwise or wi"
