    "he value it held.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Atomic::fetch_xor\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Atomic::fetch_xor<T: integer>(ref<Atomi"
    "c<T>, shared> a, T n) : T\u{1f}Replaces the value `a` holds with its bitwise exclusive or with `n`, givin"
    "g the value it held.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Atomic::fetch_xor<T: integer>(ref<Atomic<T>, shared> a, T n) : T\n   "
    " in `std::sync`\n\n    Replaces the value `a` holds with its bitwise exclusive or with `n`, giving the"
    " value it held.\n\n    Example, \"Atomic::fetch_add: a counter shared by threads\":\n        Atomic<u64> "
    "hits = Atomic::new(0: u64);\n        {\n            Vec<handle<u64>> hs = Vec::new();\n            fore"
