    "is thread is spinning, waiting for another thread to change something.\n\n    The CPU's pause instruct"
    "ion: it saves power and lets the other hardware thread of the core run. Call it in\n    the body of a"
    " loop that polls an atomic; `Atomic::wait` blocks instead, for waits that may be long.\n\n    Example,"
    " \"Atomic::fetch_max: extremes and updates\":\n        Atomic<i32> a = Atomic::new(10: i32);\n        as"
