    "t struct Barrier\u{1f}A meeting point for a fixed number of threads.\u{1f}\u{1f}export struct Barrier\n    in `std::"
    "sync`\n\n    A meeting point for a fixed number of threads.\n\n    Shared by reference, as a `mutex` is."
    " `Barrier::wait` blocks until `parties` threads have called it, then\n    releases them all together "
