    "ring\n    in `std::net`\n\n    The address as text: dotted decimal, or IPv6 in RFC 5952's shortest form"
    " (`::1`).\n\n    Example, \"IpAddr::text: IPv6 in its shortest form\":\n        IpAddr ip = Result::unwra"
    "p(IpAddr::parse(\"2001:db8:0:0:0:0:0:1\"));\n        assert(IpAddr::text(&ip) == \"2001:db8::1\");\n      "
