    "etAddr a) : Result<TcpListener, NetError>\n    in `std::net`\n\n    Listens for TCP connections at `a`."
    "\n\n    Port 0 asks the system for a free port, which `local_addr` names. `Err(AddrInUse)`,\n    `Err(A"
