    "\u{1f}export fn TcpListener::set_accept_timeout_ms(ref<TcpListener, exclusive> l, u64 ms)\n    in `std::ne"
    "t`\n\n    Sets how long `accept` waits for a connection, in milliseconds; 0 waits for ever.\n\n    After"
    " the timeout `accept` gives `Err(TimedOut)` and the listener is still usable. A server loop that\n   "
