    "iting as long as the system does.\n\n    `Err(Refused)` when nothing listens there, `Err(TimedOut)`, `"
    "Err(Unreachable)`. `connect_timeout`\n    bounds the wait.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::net\u{1f}TcpStream::connect_timeout\u{1f}fn\u{1f}e"
    "xport fn TcpStream::connect_timeout(SocketAddr a, u64 ms) : Result<TcpStream, NetError>\u{1f}Connects to "
    "`a`, waiting at most `ms` milliseconds.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn TcpStream::connect_timeout(SocketAddr a, u64 ms) "
