    "nds.\n\n    `Err(TimedOut)` when the time passes first; an `ms` of 0 is taken as 1. Other errors as `c"
    "onnect`'s.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::net\u{1f}TcpStream::peer_addr\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn TcpStream::peer_addr(ref<TcpStream, shared> "
