    "tringView> from r\n    in `std::http`\n\n    The value of the request's first header named `name`, igno"
    "ring ASCII case.\n\n    Example, \"Request::header: names ignore case\":\n        Request r = Request::ne"
    "w(\"POST\", \"https://example.com/upload\");\n        Vec::push(&mut r.headers, Header::new(\"Content-Type"
