    " exactly `name`; `None` when there is none.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::database::postgres\u{1f}PgConnection\u{1f}struct\u{1f}export res"
    "ource struct PgConnection\u{1f}An open connection to a PostgreSQL server.\u{1f}\u{1f}export resource struct PgConne"
    "ction\n    in `std::database::postgres`\n\n    An open connection to a PostgreSQL server.\n\n    Not inde"
    "pendently audited: this client is implemented to PostgreSQL's wire protocol and RFC 5802 and\n    RFC"
