    "w url, ref<TrustStore, shared> roots, u64 timeout_ms) : Result<PgConnection, PgError>\u{1f}Connects to th"
    "e server `url` names, verifying its certificate against `roots`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn PgConnection::connect_wi"
    "th(StringView url, ref<TrustStore, shared> roots, u64 timeout_ms) : Result<PgConnection, PgError>\n  "
