    "hen it is an array, or `None` for another kind of value.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::encoding::toml\u{1f}Toml::as_table\u{1f}fn\u{1f}exp"
    "ort fn Toml::as_table(ref<Toml, shared> t) : Option<ref<Vec<TomlMember>, shared>>\u{1f}The members of `t`"
    ", in order, when it is a table, or `None` for another kind of value.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Toml::as_table(ref<T"
    "oml, shared> t) : Option<ref<Vec<TomlMember>, shared>>\n    in `std::encoding::toml`\n\n    The members"
