    "\u{1f}\u{1e}std::encoding::toml\u{1f}Toml::push\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Toml::push(ref<Toml, exclusive> t, Toml v)\u{1f}Appends `v`"
    " to the array `t`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Toml::push(ref<Toml, exclusive> t, Toml v)\n    in `std::encoding::toml"
    "`\n\n    Appends `v` to the array `t`.\n\n    Faults (`diag.assert-failed`) when `t` is not an array.\n\n "
    "   Example, \"Toml::set: building a document\":\n        Toml doc = TomlTable(Vec::new());\n        Toml"
    "::set(&mut doc, \"name\", TomlString(\"demo\"));\n        Toml ports = TomlArray(Vec::new());\n        Tom"
