    "a * b`, or the nearest limit of `T` when it does not fit (`rule.arith.alt`).\n\u{1f}\u{1e}the language\u{1f}checked_"
    "add\u{1f}built in fn\u{1f}fn checked_add<T>(T a, T b) : Option<T>\u{1f}`Some(a + b)`, or `None` when it does not fi"
