    "e.arith.alt`).\u{1f}\u{1f}fn checked_mul<T>(T a, T b) : Option<T>\n    in `the language`\n\n    `Some(a * b)`, or"
    " `None` when it does not fit in `T` (`rule.arith.alt`).\n\u{1f}\u{1e}the language\u{1f}checked_div\u{1f}built in fn\u{1f}fn ch"
    "ecked_div<T>(T a, T b) : Option<T>\u{1f}`Some(a / b)`, or `None` when `b` is zero or the quotient does no"
    "t fit in `T` (`rule.arith.alt`).\u{1f}\u{1f}fn checked_div<T>(T a, T b) : Option<T>\n    in `the language`\n\n   "
    " `Some(a / b)`, or `None` when `b` is zero or the quotient does not fit in `T` (`rule.arith.alt`).\n\u{1f}"
